AEGIS Dashboard — Static JS Dependencies
=========================================

The dashboard requires two JS files for air-gapped operation.
Download them during install and place them in this directory:

  htmx.min.js    — https://unpkg.com/htmx.org@1.9.10/dist/htmx.min.js
  alpine.min.js  — https://unpkg.com/alpinejs@3.13.5/dist/cdn.min.js

Without these files the dashboard UI will not function.
